      "caption": "FIGURE 2.7 Consequences of random mating with X-linked genes. Genotype frequencies in females equal the Hardy-Weinberg frequencies, and genotype frequencies in males equal the allele frequencies in gametes.",
      "source_pdf": "data/背景资料/PopGen_chapter2.pdf",
      "source_paddle_raw": "tmp/book_audits/PopGen/source/paddle/PopGen_chapter2_full/intermediate/paddle_raw_response.json",
      "page": 27,
      "raw_bbox": [
